{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.html#Lean.Markdown.extractRefDefs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">extractRefDefs</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">source</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Block.html#Lean.Markdown.Block.Raw\">Block.Raw</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Greedily consumes link ref definitions from the front of `source`.\n\nReturns the extracted `linkRefDef` blocks together with the residual `InlineSource`. The residual is\n`none` when the definitions consumed every line.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.html#Lean.Markdown.extractRefDefs","kind":"def","line":172,"name":"Lean.Markdown.extractRefDefs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.lean#L172-L190"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkRefDef?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseLinkRefDef?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">source</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineSource.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineSource\">InlineSource</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">start</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Inline.html#Lean.Markdown.RefDef\">RefDef</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">s</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice.Pos\">Pos</a></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Tries to parse a CommonMark link reference definition that starts at `start` in `source`. Recognizes\nboth bracketed `<url>` and unbracketed link destinations, and optional `\"…\"`/`'…'`/`(…)` titles\n(which may appear on the line that follows the URL). The label may span multiple lines, but blank\nlines are not permitted inside it.\n\nReturns the definition plus the position one past the last consumed character.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkRefDef?","kind":"def","line":124,"name":"Lean.Markdown.parseLinkRefDef?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.lean#L124-L153"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkLabel?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseLinkLabel?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> (<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Lines.html#Lean.Markdown.Lines\">Lines</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses the content of a link label (CommonMark §6.3) at `cur`, which is positioned just after the\n`[`. A label may span lines, but blank lines and unescaped brackets are not permitted inside it, and\nit must contain at least one non-whitespace character and at most 999 characters. Returns the\nlabel's lines and the final cursor, which is positioned at the closing `]`.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.html#Lean.Markdown.parseLinkLabel?","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"Lean.Markdown.parseLinkLabel?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/RefDef.lean#L27-L63"}}],"imports":["Init.While","Lean.Data.Markdown.Block","Lean.Data.Markdown.InlineCursor","Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.LinkSyntax","Lean.Data.Markdown.Text"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Data.Markdown.Parser.RefDef"}